# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Audit run artifacts. The flow scripts, the CDP harness and the launchers in
# .audit/ are source and are committed; what a run *produces* is not — each
# launch creates a throwaway browser profile directory and a log beside it, and
# scratch probes are named tmp-*. Ignore everything in .audit/ except the
# reusable scripts, so a new profile or log name never needs a new rule.
.audit/*
!.audit/*.mjs
!.audit/*.sh
.audit/tmp-*

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
